---
import { recruitment } from '../config/event.mjs';
---
<section class="ah-recruitment ah-section" id="recruitment" aria-labelledby="recruitment-heading">
  <h2 id="recruitment-heading" class="ah-recruitment-heading">参与指引</h2>
  <div class="ah-recruitment-grid">
    <article id="speaker-recruitment"><h3>{recruitment.speakers.title}</h3><p>游戏创作、站点运营、技术或教育实践，欢迎带来你的主题。</p><a class="ah-secondary" href="#registration" data-recruit="speaker">{recruitment.speakers.ctaLabel}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ah-recruitment-detail-link" href="#recruitment-notes">讲者提案与站点说明 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></article>
    <article id="site-guidance"><h3>{recruitment.sites.title}</h3><p>准备本地负责人、组织团队与场地，<br />再通过 GGJ 官网的<br />Start a Jam Site 入口提交申请。</p><a class="ah-secondary" href={recruitment.sites.guideUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看官方申请指引<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ah-recruitment-detail-link" href="#faq-site-official">了解现场站点咨询 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></article>
  </div>
  <details class="ah-highlights-detail" id="recruitment-notes"><summary>提案与 GGJ 站点说明 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p class="ah-recruitment-note">{recruitment.speakers.notice}</p><p class="ah-recruitment-note">{recruitment.sites.notice} <a href={recruitment.sites.guideUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 GGJ 官方站点指引</a></p></details>
</section>
